        {
          "text": "I proposed one payment to Contoso. It still needs your approval before any money moves.\n\n**Proposed:**\n- **PAY-001** for **INV-102**: 8400.00 USDC to Contoso Grid Services. The invoice is for October grid maintenance and is due 2026-11-20. The payment goes to Contoso's registered payout address, `0x52643A794E3Ea74898a4564Cb588079b5c480A93`. The invoice is open, Contoso's vendor account is active, the invoice had no earlier payment, and the treasury has 100,000.00 USDC.\n\n**Not proposed:**\n- **INV-104** (2100.00 USDC, due 2026-10-30): the invoice is in dispute, so it can't be paid. If the dispute is settled and the invoice is reopened, I can propose that payment then.\n\n**Needs your attention:**\n- Please review and approve PAY-001.\n- Contoso's note on INV-102 just describes the invoice. It doesn't ask to change the payment address or anything else.",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "model": "claude-opus-5-5",
      "stop_details": null,
      "stop_reason": "end_turn",
